<h3>Products Catalog</h3>
<hr />
<p>
    <strong>Welcome to CleanArchMvc.WebUi!</strong> This project is structured using several proven software design patterns to ensure code quality, maintainability, and scalability:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>
        <strong>Domain-Driven Design (DDD):</strong> Separates business logic from infrastructure and UI, focusing on the core domain.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Repository Pattern:</strong> Abstracts data access, making it easier to manage and test data operations.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Service Layer Pattern:</strong> Encapsulates business logic in services, keeping controllers and UI code clean.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>DTOs (Data Transfer Objects):</strong> Used to transfer data between layers, improving security and performance.
    </li>
    <li>
        <strong>Dependency Injection:</strong> Promotes loose coupling and testability by injecting dependencies.
    </li>
</ul>
<p>
    Explore the <a asp-controller="Categories" asp-action="Index">Categories</a> and <a asp-controller="Products" asp-action="Index">Products</a> sections to see these patterns in action.
</p>